    "Each season's width is proportional to how long it really lasts — Ordinary Time is most of the year, Lent is 40 days, the Triduum barely shows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each season's width is proportional to how long it really lasts — Ordinary Time is most of the year, Lent is 40 days, the Triduum barely shows."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A largura de cada tempo é proporcional à sua duração real — o Tempo Comum é a maior parte do ano, a Quaresma são 40 dias, o Tríduo mal aparece."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El ancho de cada tiempo es proporcional a su duración real — el Tiempo Ordinario es la mayor parte del año, la Cuaresma son 40 días, el Triduo apenas aparece."
          }
        }
      }
    },
